  "description": "Tap the instant a closing ring hits the bouncing ball — every ring lands on a beat of the track, but some beats are empty. Chain perfect taps for a huge combo, then survive the spiked sudden-death ring. On the web the climb crosses five worlds, each with its own rings and its own rule: rewind rings that throw the others back, sticky rings that hold the ball, dark rings that must not be tapped, mixed rings whose dark parts the ball slips through untapped — and all four at once in the last.",
